    /// How many bars ahead (positive) or behind (negative) of the bar that
    /// computed it a chart draws output `output_idx`, for the optional
    /// parameters bound so far. 0 for an output without
    /// [`OutputFlags::DISPLAY_SHIFT`]. The values are never shifted.
